一、定义

"本软件" 指 LayerCut 的源代码、可执行文件及其文档。
"原作者" 指上述版权持有人 NukumizuKazuhiko。
"接收者" 指依本许可获得本软件、其修改版、产出文件或其副本的任何
个人或组织。
"修改版" 指在本软件基础上修订、翻译、增补或以其他方式衍生出的作品；
但与本软件或其修改版相分离的独立作品，或仅与其接口（或按名称绑定）
的作品，不属于修改版，无论该独立作品自身是否构成演绎作品。
"源码形式" 指进行修改时首选的便于修改的形式（即源代码）；
"目标码形式" 指源码形式以外的任何形式，包括但不限于编译产物、
可执行文件与打包文件。
"产出文件" 指由本软件或其修改版直接或间接生成、导出或渲染的任何文件，
包括但不限于导出的图像（PNG 等）、矢量图（SVG 等）与工程文件；
参照 Apache-2.0 对 "Derivative Works" 的排除性定义，本定义有意将
此类产出物纳入许可范围（Apache-2.0 第三条则将其排除在外）。
"商业性使用" 指下列任一行为：
  (a) 以本软件或其修改版对外提供网络服务（包括但不限于 SaaS、在线工具、API）；
  (b) 将本软件或其修改版制作成商业产品进行销售或收费提供；
  (c) 将本软件或其修改版随其他具有商业性质的商品或服务一并赠送、捆绑或打包分发；
  (d) 将本软件或其修改版所生产的产出文件用于商业用途，包括但不限于
      销售产出文件、将其作为商业商品或服务的组成部分、或将其用于
      盈利性的生产经营活动（如实体制作、印刷、切割加工后出售）。
"告知" 指向原作者发出的电子邮件，发送至：mihoyostart@gmail.com。
"贡献者" 指原作者以及向本软件提交代码、文档、图标或其他修改内容的任何主体；
其"贡献"指其提交的此类内容。

I. Definitions

"Software" means the LayerCut source code, binaries and documentation.
"Author" means the copyright holder NukumizuKazuhiko.
"Recipient" means any person or organization that obtains the Software,
a modified version, Output Files or copies thereof under this license.
"Modified Version" means any work derived from the Software by way of
revision, translation, augmentation or otherwise; works that are
separate from the Software or modified versions, or that merely
interface (or bind by name) to them, are not Modified Versions,
regardless of whether such separate works constitute derivative works
in themselves.
"Source form" means the preferred form for making modifications
(i.e., source code); "Object form" means any form other than Source
form, including compiled artifacts, executables and packages.
"Output Files" means any file directly or indirectly generated, exported
or rendered by the Software or a modified version, including but not
limited to exported images (PNG etc.), vector graphics (SVG etc.) and
project files. Following the drafting style of Apache-2.0's "Derivative
Works" definition, this definition deliberately brings such outputs
within the scope of this license, whereas Apache-2.0 excludes them.
"Commercial Use" means any of the following:
  (a) providing a network service with the Software or a Modified
      Version (including SaaS, online tools, APIs);
  (b) making the Software or a Modified Version into a commercial
      product that is sold or offered for a fee;
  (c) distributing the Software or a Modified Version bundled with,
      given away with, or packaged as part of other commercial goods
      or services;
  (d) using Output Files produced by the Software or a Modified Version
      for commercial purposes, including but not limited to selling the
      Output Files, incorporating them into commercial goods or
      services, or using them in for-profit production activities
      (such as physical fabrication, printing or cutting work sold
      afterwards).
"Notice" means an email to the Author at: mihoyostart@gmail.com.
"Contributor" means the Author and any person or organization that
submits code, documentation, icons or other modifications to the
Software; a "Contribution" means such submitted content.

