四、专利授权

4.1 在遵守本许可的前提下，每位贡献者就其可授权的专利权利要求，向每位
    接收者授予永久性、全球性、非排他性、免费、不可撤销
    （本条 4.2 规定的情形除外）的专利许可，允许制造、委托制造、使用、
    许诺销售、销售、进口及以其他方式转移本软件、其修改版及产出文件。
    前述"可授权的专利权利要求"指该贡献者拥有或实际控制的、可由其
    授权的专利权利要求中，被其贡献单独、或其贡献与本软件的组合
    必然侵犯的那部分权利要求。
4.2 专利诉讼终止：若任何人就本软件、其修改版、产出文件或任何贡献
    侵犯专利权而提起诉讼（包括在该诉讼中的反诉或交叉诉讼中提出
    专利权利主张），则依本条授予该提起诉讼之主体的专利许可，
    自其起诉之日起终止。专利许可的终止不影响该主体依本许可
    其他条款获得的版权及其他权利。
4.3 为明确起见：本条授予的专利许可不延伸至与本软件及其修改版分离的
    独立作品，或仅与本软件接口（或按名称绑定）的独立作品。

IV. Patent License

4.1 Subject to the terms of this license, each Contributor grants every
    Recipient a perpetual, worldwide, non-exclusive, no-charge,
    royalty-free, irrevocable (except as stated in 4.2) patent license
    to make, have made, use, offer to sell, sell, import, and otherwise
    transfer the Software, Modified Versions and Output Files.
    "Licensable patent claims" means patent claims owned or controlled
    by that Contributor, licensable by them, that are necessarily
    infringed by their Contribution alone, or by combination of their
    Contribution with the Software.
4.2 Termination for patent litigation: if any person institutes patent
    litigation against any entity (including a cross-claim or
    counterclaim in a lawsuit) alleging that the Software, a Modified
    Version, Output Files or any Contribution infringes a patent, the
    patent licenses granted to that person under this Section terminate
    as of the date the litigation is filed. Termination of the patent
    license does not affect the copyright or other rights such person
    holds under the other Sections of this license.
4.3 For clarity: the patent license in this Section does not extend to
    works that are separate from the Software and Modified Versions, or
    that merely interface (or bind by name) to the Software.

