五、再分发条件

任何人以源码形式或目标码形式再分发本软件或其修改版（无论是否修改），
应满足以下全部条件：
  (a) 向所有接收者随附本许可全文及上述版权声明；
  (b) 使修改过的文件带有显著声明，表明你对其作出了修改；
  (c) 以源码形式再分发时，保留源文件中的全部版权、专利、商标及
      署名声明（与该修改版无关的声明除外）；
  (d) 若本软件随附 "NOTICE" 文本文件，则再分发包含修改版时，应至少在
      以下位置之一保留其中与该修改版相关的署名声明：随修改版分发的
      NOTICE 文本、源文件、文档、或由再分发者生成的展示页面；
      该义务仅在与署名声明相关的范围内持续；
  (e) 你可以在你自己的修改版上附加你自己的版权声明，并可以就你的
      修改按本许可或按更严格的自行条款提供（但不得限制本许可授予
      接收者的权利）；
  (f) 以目标码形式再分发时，上述 (c)(d) 所要求的声明应包含在随同
      分发的文档或其他随附材料中。
上述条件不改变第三条的效力：再分发本身若构成商业性使用（如销售、
收费提供、商业捆绑），仍应按第三条告知。

V. Redistribution Conditions

Anyone redistributing the Software or a Modified Version, in Source
form or Object form, with or without modification, shall meet all of
the following conditions:
  (a) give all recipients a copy of this License and the copyright
      notice above;
  (b) cause any modified files to carry prominent notices stating that
      you changed them;
  (c) when redistributing in Source form, retain in each source file
      all copyright, patent, trademark and attribution notices,
      excluding those that do not pertain to any part of the Modified
      Version;
  (d) if the Software ships with a "NOTICE" text file, retain the
      attribution notices within that Notice file that pertain to the
      Modified Version, in at least one of the following places: within
      a NOTICE text file distributed with the Modified Version, within
      the source files, within the documentation, and/or generated
      display pages of the redistributor; such notices remain for as
      long as they pertain;
  (e) you may add your own copyright statement to your Modified
      Versions, and may license your modifications under this license
      or under your own stricter terms (provided you do not restrict
      the rights granted to recipients under this license);
  (f) when redistributing in Object form, the notices required by (c)
      and (d) shall be included in the accompanying documentation or
      other materials distributed with it.
These conditions do not affect Section III: if the redistribution itself
constitutes a Commercial Use (such as selling, offering for a fee, or
commercial bundling), a Notice under Section III is still required.

