使用、复制、修改、再分发该贡献。原作者可在不改变本许可的前提下
将这些贡献并入本软件。

VI. Submission of Contributions

Unless the contributor explicitly states additional terms at submission
time, any Contribution submitted to the Software (including pull
requests, patches, code attached to issues, documentation and icons)
constitutes the contributor's grant to the Author and all Recipients of
the rights to use, copy, modify and redistribute that Contribution under
this license (including the patent license in Section IV). The Author
may incorporate such Contributions into the Software without altering
this license.

